  "releaseNotes": "TinyEvents 0.1.0-alpha.3\n\n      Added\n      - Public MigrateTinyEventsAsync entry point and scoped migrator contract.\n      - Generated event dispatchers that avoid runtime reflection and assembly scanning.\n      - Structured, secret-safe outbox processing and migration logging.\n      - Explicit database-provider registration exclusivity and option validation.\n\n      Hardened\n      - Cancellation boundaries, retry persistence, lease-loss detection, and failure classification.\n      - Multi-assembly generated consumer registration and package boundaries.\n\n      Compatibility\n      - Early alpha / active development.\n      - APIs may change before 1.0.\n      - Upgrade every TinyEvents package in the application to alpha.3 together.",
